     },
     {
      "name": "Description",
      "type": "rich_text",
      "value": "A step-by-step guide to buying your first home: what to do before you apply, fixed or variable rates, and the costs to plan for."
     }
    ]
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Buying your first home is exciting, and a little daunting. This guide walks you through it, one step at a time."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "url": "https://main--ew-shareready--vipult2022.aem.page/offers/media_1defbd87e89df4fe450e5ac7c8976218033e0f79e.jpg?width=1200&format=jpg&optimize=medium",
     "expires": false,
     "caption": [
      {
       "text": "Keys to a new front door"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading_1",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Before you apply"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "to_do",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Check your credit report for mistakes"
      }
     ],
     "checked": true
    },
    {
     "type": "to_do",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Save a deposit of at least 5%, or 10% for better rates"
      }
     ],
     "checked": false
    },
    {
     "type": "to_do",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Get a decision in principle, so you know what you can borrow"
      }
     ],
     "checked": false
    },
    {
     "type": "heading_1",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed or variable?"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "column_list",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "column",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "heading_3",
         "rich": [
          {
           "text": "Fixed rate"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "rich": [
          {
           "text": "Your payment stays the same for 2, 5 or 10 years. "
          },
          {
           "text": "Best if",
           "bold": true
          },
          {
           "text": " you want certainty."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "column",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "heading_3",
         "rich": [
          {
           "text": "Variable rate"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "rich": [
          {
           "text": "Your payment moves with our base rate. "
          },
          {
           "text": "Best if",
           "bold": true
          },
          {
           "text": " you can handle changes and want flexibility."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading_1",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Costs to plan for"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulleted_list_item",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Deposit"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulleted_list_item",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Fees"
      }
     ],
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "bulleted_list_item",
       "rich": [
        {
         "text": "Valuation fee"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "bulleted_list_item",
       "rich": [
        {
         "text": "Legal fees"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "bulleted_list_item",
       "rich": [
        {
         "text": "Arrangement fee, often added to the loan"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulleted_list_item",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Moving and furniture"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading_1",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "Questions"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "toggle",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "How much can I borrow?"
      }
     ],
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "rich": [
        {
         "text": "Usually up to 4.5 times your yearly income. Use our "
        },
        {
         "text": "mortgage calculator",
         "href": "https://www.example.com/calculator"
        },
        {
         "text": " for an estimate."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "toggle",
     "rich": [
      {
       "text": "How long does it take?"
      }
     ],
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "rich": [
        {
         "text": "Most applications get a decision within 5 working days."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
